# Local dev uses http://localhost:8000 by default.
# For production (Vercel): set REACT_APP_API_URL in Vercel Project Settings → Environment Variables
#   so the app calls your deployed API instead of localhost (avoids "Access other apps" prompt and $0 portfolio).
# Example:
# REACT_APP_API_URL=https://your-api.up.railway.app
#
# After adding API routes (e.g. GET /live-benchmark), redeploy Railway so production
# matches this frontend build, or the UI will show HTTP 404 on new endpoints.
